  "descriptionEn": "First archived Bremen source snapshot for upper-secondary mathematics. The snapshot activates a structural starting surface based on the 2022 curriculum with an orientation anchor, the introductory phase, the four qualification semesters, and the three upper-secondary subject areas analysis, stochastics, and linear algebra / analytic geometry.",
