      "titleEn": "Stochastics 2: The Binomial Distribution as a Special Discrete Probability Distribution",
      "description": "Der Bremer S2-Korridor fuehrt die Oberstufenstochastik mit Binomialverteilungen, kumulierten Wahrscheinlichkeiten, Parameterschaetzungen, Konfidenzintervallen und Hypothesentests fort.",
      "descriptionEn": "The Bremen S2 corridor continues upper-secondary stochastics with binomial distributions, cumulative probabilities, parameter estimation, confidence intervals, and hypothesis tests.",
